    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25311" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαμ-πάξ</span></b>  (for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δι-ανα-πάξ</span>), Adv.
